<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Text To Word</title></head><body><p>Based on the components visible in your Arduino Nano kit (Arduino Nano, breadboard, 16x2 LCD, ultrasonic sensor, servo motor, relay module, water pump, rain sensor, alcohol sensor, flame sensor, LDR, buzzer, battery, jumper wires, etc.), here are **10 practical projects** you can build:<br><br>1. **Smart Water Level Monitoring System**<br><br>* Components: Arduino Nano, Ultrasonic Sensor, LCD, Buzzer<br>* Displays water level and alerts when the tank is full or empty.<br><br>2. **Automatic Rain Detection System**<br><br>* Components: Rain Sensor, Buzzer, LCD<br>* Detects rainfall and gives an alert.<br><br>3. **Alcohol Detection &amp; Alert System**<br><br>* Components: MQ-3 Alcohol Sensor, Buzzer, LCD<br>* Detects alcohol vapors and displays status.<br><br>4. **Fire/Flame Detection Alarm**<br><br>* Components: Flame Sensor, Buzzer, LCD<br>* Detects flames and triggers an alarm.<br><br>5. **Automatic Street Light**<br><br>* Components: LDR, LED, Arduino Nano<br>* Turns lights ON at night and OFF during the day.<br><br>6. **Touchless Automatic Dustbin**<br><br>* Components: Ultrasonic Sensor, Servo Motor<br>* Opens the lid automatically when a hand approaches.<br><br>7. **Automatic Water Pump Controller**<br><br>* Components: Relay Module, Water Pump, Ultrasonic Sensor<br>* Controls the water pump based on tank level.<br><br>8. **Distance Measurement System**<br><br>* Components: Ultrasonic Sensor, LCD<br>* Measures and displays the distance of nearby objects.<br><br>9. **Obstacle Detection Alarm**<br><br>* Components: Ultrasonic Sensor, Buzzer<br>* Sounds an alarm when an obstacle comes within a set distance.<br><br>10. **Smart Home Appliance Control**<br><br>* Components: Relay Module, Arduino Nano<br>* Controls a low-voltage appliance automatically based on sensor input (such as light or distance).<br><br>### Bonus Project Ideas<br><br>* Smart Parking Sensor<br>* Water Leakage Detector<br>* Automatic Door Opening System<br>* Mini Security Alarm<br>* Digital Distance Meter<br>* Tank Overflow Alarm<br>* Smart Irrigation Prototype<br>* Intruder Alert System<br>* Servo-Based Barrier Gate<br>* Multi-Sensor Home Automation Demo<br><br>With this kit alone, you can easily build **20–30 beginner to intermediate Arduino projects** without needing many additional components.</p></body></html>